{"title":"2000 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many whole numbers lie in the interval between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae6ca439f90be5b87b92cab8cfd6ea9e3f23475.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709acef3551b886e6754de72d59a88f00660f0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/240eace42419ad5da86b1cbc4a7f6a67d7277fb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{infinitely many}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e45f7189dcd6cfab9e62b2efe2bdf6c578a9a5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; \\frac{5}{3} &lt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" /> while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b011d0f90461d6c4c5abf9f7b14ff07cc356b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 &lt; 2\\pi &lt; 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore, the interval from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae6ca439f90be5b87b92cab8cfd6ea9e3f23475.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/9/709acef3551b886e6754de72d59a88f00660f0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" /> contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a42524741cb8781a00318850f8d3183f191ac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" /> whole numbers: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:9